    "result": "macOS full gate passed; Ubuntu stopped at existing GPU exact-byte boundary test returning no observation (0 versus 1). Exact incident return reason remains unproven.",
    "raw_log_sha256": "58f5f8da0893688dca5e56a26888680e53b3edefbbfb4454707704ae17a172d7"
