  "retained_failures": [
    "First local contract run compiled, then fixture header WouldBlock and a second Drop panic caused SIGABRT after three passing tests. Cause inherited-nonblocking versus speculative idle connection was not established; bounded concurrent blocking handlers and safe unwind reporting were added.",
    "Original Ubuntu GPU failure is retained without attribution to the separate POSIX pipe inheritance demonstration. The test-only byte-limit fixture now verifies successful real child output length in a finite private file; all production GPU collection code and separate live-stream/EOF/backpressure/timeout cases remain unchanged."
  ],
  "checks": [
    "PASS full scripts/quality-gate.sh on Ubuntu 24.04 and macOS 15: all-features, no-default-features, SPACE-only contract selection, fmt/Clippy/docs/builds and managed/PTY performance.",
    "Eight simultaneous starts share one stable native claim and append exactly once in the fixture; this is not arbitrary external-effect exactly-once execution.",
    "Three managed and fifteen PTY samples per OS; twelve SPACE cases under all-features and SPACE-without-Boat on each OS. No-default-feature selection correctly excludes the optional provider tests."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "No live SPACE deployment, Linux/KVM isolation, cross-host transport, physical power loss, resource provisioning or billing qualification.",
    "Attach only with existing sandbox, trusted guest parent directory, same explicit guest user and installed SDK supervisor; no lifecycle mutation or port publication.",
    "SSE transports short RPCs; native SDK records remain durable execution/output authority. Disconnect or missing acknowledgement does not confirm workload termination.",
    "Ambiguous private uploads retain the prepared private file and are not invoked/replayed; owner cleanup requires transport quiescence. SPACE may retain file payloads internally and workload output may reveal secrets.",
    "Native resource observations remain conservative. The original Ubuntu return reason is unproven; the separate inherited-writer mechanism is not an incident diagnosis.",
    "Hosted debug performance samples are qualification samples, not a statistical regression baseline."
  ],
